10 REM ON GOTO and ON GOSUB: index 0, 1, the last, past the last, rounded
20 FOR I=0 TO 4
30 ON I GOTO 100,110,120
40 PRINT "fell through";I
50 NEXT I
60 X=2.5:ON X GOTO 130,140,150
70 X=1.49:ON X GOTO 160,170
80 FOR I=0 TO 4:ON I GOSUB 200,210,220:PRINT "back";I:NEXT I
90 GOTO 300
100 PRINT "at 100";I:GOTO 50
110 PRINT "at 110";I:GOTO 50
120 PRINT "at 120";I:GOTO 50
